        <p class="advertorial-launch-lead">Five Selected Advertorials — No Writing or Publication Charge</p>
        <p>To mark the launch of <em>Murtaza Insights</em>, five businesses or organisations will be selected to have an advertorial prepared and published on the website at no writing or publication charge.</p>
        <p>Selection will be based on relevance to the website and potential usefulness to readers.</p>
        <p class="advertorial-launch-contact"><strong>Interested?</strong> Email <a href="mailto:saeedtaz2003@gmail.com?subject=Advertorial%20Enquiry">saeedtaz2003@gmail.com</a></p>
      </aside>

      <h2>Launch Offer Details</h2>
      <p>The five businesses or organisations will be selected according to their relevance to the subjects covered by <em>Murtaza Insights</em> and the potential usefulness of the article to its readers.</p>
      <p>The offer is therefore not based simply on the first five applications received.</p>
      <p>Suitable subjects may include business, finance, accounting, investment, technology, artificial intelligence, management systems, professional services and other topics relevant to the <em>Murtaza Insights</em> audience.</p>
      <p>Selected participants will receive:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>an advertorial of approximately 800–1,200 words</li>
        <li>assistance in developing and presenting the story</li>
        <li>editing and preparation of the final article</li>
        <li>inclusion of suitable photographs, graphics or company information</li>
        <li>relevant links to the business or organisation</li>
        <li>publication on <em>Murtaza Insights</em></li>
        <li>promotion through selected <em>Murtaza Insights</em> social-media channels</li>
      </ul>
      <p>There will be no writing or publication charge for the five selected launch advertorials.</p>
      <p>Selected advertorials will remain published for a minimum of six months and may remain available for longer. However, <em>Murtaza Insights</em> reserves the right to amend or remove content if it becomes inaccurate, outdated, legally problematic or otherwise unsuitable.</p>

      <h2>Advertorial Services</h2>
      <p>Depending on your requirements, I can assist with:</p>
      <h3>Custom Advertorial Articles</h3>
      <p>An original article developed around your business, product, service or campaign.</p>
      <h3>Business &amp; Brand Profiles</h3>
      <p>Tell the story behind your company, its history, people, achievements, services and future plans.</p>
      <h3>Product or Service Features</h3>
      <p>Explain what your product or service does, who it is intended for and what makes it different.</p>
      <h3>Sponsored Thought-Leadership Articles</h3>
      <p>Share your knowledge or perspective on an issue relevant to your industry while identifying your organisation as the commissioning business.</p>
      <h3>Editing Advertiser-Supplied Content</h3>
      <p>If you already have an article or draft, it can be edited and formatted to make it clearer, more readable and suitable for publication on <em>Murtaza Insights</em>.</p>
      <h3>Supporting Images and Graphics</h3>
      <p>Suitable photographs, charts, illustrations or graphics supplied by the business may be incorporated where appropriate.</p>
      <p>All proposed advertorials remain subject to suitability for the website and agreement on the final content before publication.</p>

      <h2>Transparency &amp; Disclosure</h2>
      <p>Reader trust is important.</p>
      <p>Each published advertorial will be clearly identified at the beginning of the article.</p>
      <p>Suggested wording:</p>
      <aside class="advertorial-disclosure">
        <strong>ADVERTORIAL</strong>
        <p>This advertorial was commissioned by [Company Name] and prepared in collaboration with the company. It is promotional content and is separate from the independent articles, analysis and commentary published on <em>Murtaza Insights</em>.</p>
      </aside>
      <p>All information and claims must be capable of reasonable verification.</p>

